  "reference": "Nehemia 6",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NEH 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanibalati, Tobia na Geshemu Omuarabu n'ababisha baitu abandi bagambirwa okwo nyombekire eboma n'okwo hatasigairwemu kihuru (mara omu kanya ako nkaba ntakatairemu nyigi za mataho). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanibalati na Geshemu bantumaho bati, “Oije tubuganganwe omu kyaro kimoiho omu muteleka gwa Ono.” Kyonkai bakaba bagendeleire kunyita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbatumaho entumwa nti, “Ninkora omulimo guhango, tinakushobora kwija okwo. Kubaki omulimo gwemelere aha rw'enshonga ngu naija okwo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantumaho batyo emirundi enai nanye mbagarukamu ntyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu migilire yonene, Sanibalati antumaho omurundi gwa katanu omwiruwe aina ebarua etakomire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba ehandikirwe eti, “Kyamanyikire omu mahanga, na Geshemu kwakwo nakigamba okwo iwe n'Abayahudi mulikwenda kushenga; nikyo mulikwombekera eboma; mara noyenda kuba mukama wabo nk'okwo kilikugambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi otaireho abarangi kukuranga omuli Yerusalemu bati, ‘Omuli Yuda halimu omukama.’ Mbwenu ebigambo ebi nibija kumanyika aha Mukama Aritashasita. Aha rw'ekyo oije tweme hamoi tutegeke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mutumaho nti, “Ebi ebyo wagamba tibikabahoga, ahakuba iwe nobigunjagunja omu mutima gwawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomanya bona bakaba nibenda kutukanga nibalenga bati, “Amani garabahwa n'eikora lyemelere tilikorwe.” Kyonkai mbwenu waitu Ruhanga bantunge amani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanatahire omwa Shemaya eya Delaya, Delaya eya Mehetabeli, akaba afungiirwe omwe, agamba ati, “Tubuganganwe Rwensinga, mara tukinge enyigi zayo aha rw'okuba nibaija kukwita omu kiro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ngamba nti, “Omushaija nkanye nyiruke? Mushaijaki nkanye ayakusingirwa Rwensinga ngu batamwita?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkashobokerwa nabona Ruhanga okwo yabaire atamutumire, shana akaba nabingambaho aha rw'enshonga Tobia na Sanibalati bakaba bamutilize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'enshonga egyo akaba atiziibwe ntine nkore ntyo nfakare, baije banyite eibara kunshesheza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Ruhanga wange, oraijuka Tobia na Sanibalati aha rw'ebi ebyo bakozire, oshube oijuke n'eby'omurangi Noadia n'abarangi abandi ababaire nibenda kuntinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo aha kiro kya 52 makumi gabili na bitanu ky'omwezi gwa Eluli eboma ehwa, ehwera omu biro 52 bibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo ababisha baitu bona bakihuliire, amahanga gona agatwataine gatina, gahwa eishaija aha rw'okuba gakamanya okw'omulimo ogwo gwahoire aha rw'obujuni bwa Ruhanga waitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu biro ebyo abakungu ba Yuda bakatwekera Tobia ebarua zingi, na Tobia abahandikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangi omuli Yuda bakaba bakozire endagano nawe, aha rw'enshonga akaba ali mukoi wa Shekania eya Ara, kandi omutabani Yehohanani akaba ashweire muhara wa Meshulamu eya Berekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashuba bamutenda omu maisho gange mara bamugambira n'ebyange. Kandi Tobia yata nantwekera ebarua kuntinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
